          "short": "$-\\frac{3}{4}$",
          "worked": "Parallel lines have equal gradients. The coefficient of $x$ is $-\\frac{3}{4}$, so $m_{\\mathrm{par}} = -\\frac{3}{4}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 10
      },
      {
        "id": "p20-q1-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$y = \\frac{8x}{7} - \\frac{1}{2}$",
