          "worked": "Parallel lines have equal gradients. Since $\\frac{8x}{7} = \\frac{8}{7}x$, the gradient is $\\frac{8}{7}$, so $m_{\\mathrm{par}} = \\frac{8}{7}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
